  "note": "Complete load_point_cloud CSV function: real file parsing, Python float conversions, finite validation, XYZ assembly, owned Open3D conversion, empty check and internal cleanup. Returned-cloud release, output hashing/byte validation, imports, fingerprints, CSV export and CLI serialization excluded from timing. Only finite-filter batching changes. Full existing compared subsets of measured source clouds are exported to CSV without changing any f64 coordinate bits or order; they are not native sensor CSV logs or independent surveys. No generated points, perturbation, further thinning, replaced parser or read result. All measured inputs are finite; nonfinite/malformed semantics are tested separately. Excluded full byte-parity pair, separate first pair and two warm-up pairs precede five default alternating timed pairs. Fresh process per dataset/pass; first policy balanced across passes; all observations retained. Warm pages. Full cloud remains in memory; this is not a streaming API. No cold CLI, peak RSS, whole comparison, registration or GPU speed claim."
